"_id":"cTkIKg8bLMFZ2eco","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688880217246,"modifiedTime":1688880261663,"lastModifiedBy":"CIWVguTLismR00HG","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Bastard Sword Pseudopod","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[{"domain":"damage","key":"RollOption","label":"PF2E.SpecificRule.TwoHanded.BastardSword","option":"two-handed","toggleable":true,"value":false},{"key":"DamageDice","label":"PF2E.TraitTwoHandD12","override":{"dieSize":"d12"},"predicate":["two-handed"],"selector":"{item|_id}-damage"}],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["two-hand-d12"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"UDLOPR7qgOX8EG6J":{"damage":"3d8+14","damageType":"slashing","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":27},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"YTe5OMWsEypVQdUv","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688880218228,"modifiedTime":1688880452465,"lastModifiedBy":"CIWVguTLismR00HG","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Issue Challenge","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The wannabe knight points at a foe, usually the strongest looking creature it can see, issuing a challenge to single combat. That creature can choose whether to accept. If the creature denies the challenge, the wannabe knight wins by default. If the creature accepts, both it and the knight gain 50 temporary Hit Points, which only protect them from damage they each deal to the other. They can only attack each other for the duration of the challenge and if any ally assists the challenged opponent, the challenged opponent forfeits and loses. When either combatant reduces the other's temporary Hit Points from Issue Challenge to 0, they are the victor and gain a +2 status bonus to attack rolls, saving throws, and skill checks for 1 minute. Additionally if the wannabe knight wins, its opponent becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Frightened]{Frightened 2}. Afterward, the challenged creature is temporarily immune for 1 month.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-su-effects.Item.Ny7avkVmbodeOwUp]{Effect: Issue Challenge (Participants)}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-su-effects.Item.JSWho9M2QqePR4f5]{Effect: Issue Challenge (Victor)}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["mental","visual"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":3},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"zVsMjrtflEQNNwda","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"flags":{"core":{}},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688880531830,"modifiedTime":1688926372231,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Actor.N6fhuATeclvEg2wN.Item.zVsMjrtflEQNNwda","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Mount Up","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The wannabe knight creates a growth that extends below it and out of its armor to form a mount, which typically resembles a featureless black horse whose shape is slightly off. While \"mounted,\" the wannabe knight's size increases to Large, it gains a +20-foot circumstance bonus to its Speed, and it takes a –2 penalty to its AC.</p>"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"mount-up","domain":"all","toggleable":true,"value":false},{"key":"CreatureSize","value":"large","predicate":["mount-up"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"ac","value":-2,"type":"circumstance","predicate":["mount-up"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"land-speed","value":20,"predicate":["mount-up"],"type":"circumstance"},{"key":"TokenImage","value":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/Tokens/wannabe-knight-riding.webp","scale":2,"predicate":["mount-up"],"ring":{"subject":{"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/subjects/wannabe-knight-riding.webp","scale":2}}}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"rMHJlp2YxgTaHXo2","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.8.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688880681818,"modifiedTime":1736310213012,"lastModifiedBy":"pE7amWuydpTk8Jkp","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Pseudopod Weapons","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The wannabe knight forms a pseudopod that appears to be a lance or bastard sword held in its hand. The weaponized pseudopod remains until it uses this action again to change its type or remove it. The wannabe knight's pseudopods are limited to one at a time, and while wielding its shield, it can spare only one \"hand\" for the pseudopod weapons; this means it deals d8 damage from the bastard sword pseudopod and can only use the lance pseudopod when mounted via Mount Up with the jousting trait. Without the shield, it can deal d12 damage with the bastard sword pseudopod and use the lance pseudopod in both hands for its full damage.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["manipulate"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"1yKxu6c0ySi2rQ6g","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688881002003,"modifiedTime":1688881070020,"lastModifiedBy":"CIWVguTLismR00HG","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Whirlwind Charge","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The wannabe knight Strides up to twice its Speed in a straight line and can make a Strike against each foe within its reach throughout the movement. These attacks increase its multiple attack penalty, but only after the Whirlwind Charge is complete.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":3},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"CCO1XUIrbjDqDOqj","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688881073866,"modifiedTime":1688881106123,"lastModifiedBy":"CIWVguTLismR00HG","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685401626117,"modifiedTime":1736542895483,"lastModifiedBy":"l2rbNx2a8f5ocpeL","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"N6fhuATeclvEg2wN","folder":"rnSyamM9GQTIpuOo","ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"sort":1400000}